BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 30 Tm (Repository Review Report) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 513 30 Tm (Page 2) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 738.00 Tm (13. Logger config referenced `env` without importing it, causing a runtime failure.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 724.00 Tm (14. Database and ImageKit config files contained large blocks of stale commented code.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 710.00 Tm (15. Global error handling did not normalize upload errors or duplicate key errors.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 680.00 Tm (Fixes Applied) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 648.00 Tm (1. Added a repository layer for users and products:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 634.00 Tm (   - `src/repositories/user.repository.js`) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 620.00 Tm (   - `src/repositories/product.repository.js`) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 606.00 Tm (2. Refactored product service so it no longer depends on Express `req` or `res`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 592.00 Tm (3. Changed product ownership to use the authenticated user's id instead of email.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 578.00 Tm (4. Scoped product list, read, update, and delete operations to the logged-in user.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 564.00 Tm (5. Added `express-validator` based product validation:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 550.00 Tm (   - create product validation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 536.00 Tm (   - update product validation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 522.00 Tm (   - product id validation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 508.00 Tm (   - product query validation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 494.00 Tm (6. Improved product upload handling with Multer limits and image MIME type filtering.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 480.00 Tm (7. Fixed ImageKit usage by calling the named `uploadFile` helper from config.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 466.00 Tm (8. Preserved existing product images during update when no new files are uploaded.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 452.00 Tm (9. Added `.env.example` so required configuration is visible.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 438.00 Tm (10. Centralized environment validation with Zod in `src/config/env.js`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 424.00 Tm (11. Fixed logger configuration and removed stale commented code from config files.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 410.00 Tm (12. Updated JWT middleware to support both cookie tokens and `Authorization: Bearer <token>`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 396.00 Tm (13. Added clean 401 handling for invalid or expired tokens.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 382.00 Tm (14. Improved global error handling for Multer errors and duplicate MongoDB key errors.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 368.00 Tm (15. Cleaned the server startup file and added graceful shutdown handling for `SIGINT` and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 354.00 Tm (`SIGTERM`.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 324.00 Tm (Setup Instructions) Tj ET
