BT /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 707.00 Tm (Summary of Changes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 675.00 Tm (The main improvement was moving the backend toward clear responsibility boundaries. Routes now) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 661.00 Tm (own request validation, controllers coordinate request and response handling, services own) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 647.00 Tm (business logic, and repositories own database access. Product authorization is now enforced at) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 633.00 Tm (the query level, which prevents users from accessing or modifying products they do not own.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 611.00 Tm (The auth flow is also safer now. User responses are sanitized, password selection is restricted) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 597.00 Tm (by default, JWT verification is centralized through validated env config, and token failures) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 583.00 Tm (return consistent unauthorized responses.) Tj ET
