BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 166.00 Tm (Main problems in the old structure:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 144.00 Tm (1. Services were directly handling database queries, so business logic and data-access logic were) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 130.00 Tm (tightly coupled.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 116.00 Tm (2. Product service tried to use Express response logic \(`res.status`\) even though services should) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 102.00 Tm (not know about `req` or `res`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 88.00 Tm (3. Validation was scattered inside service functions instead of being handled before the request) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 74.00 Tm (reached controllers/services.) Tj ET
