BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 30 Tm (Repository Review Report) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 513 30 Tm (Page 5) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 738.00 Tm (5. `product.repository.js` now performs owner-scoped product queries, updates, and deletes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 724.00 Tm (6. `env.js` validates required environment variables with Zod before the server runs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 710.00 Tm (7. `cookie.js` centralizes cookie settings for auth responses.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 696.00 Tm (8. `logger.js` centralizes structured logging.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 682.00 Tm (9. `multer.middleware.js` now protects upload endpoints with MIME type and size validation.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 652.00 Tm (Middleware, Validation, and Security Improvements) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 615.00 Tm (Validation Middleware) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 588.00 Tm (Validation was added so invalid data is rejected before it reaches controllers and services.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 574.00 Tm (This keeps the service layer focused on business rules instead of basic request checks.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 552.00 Tm (Examples:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 530.00 Tm (- Register requires valid `name`, `email`, and `password`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 516.00 Tm (- Login requires valid `email` and `password`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 502.00 Tm (- Product creation/update requires valid `name`, `price`, and optional `category`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 488.00 Tm (- Product id routes validate MongoDB ObjectId format before querying the database.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 461.00 Tm (Auth Middleware) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.00 Tm (The old auth middleware only checked a cookie token and directly called `jwt.verify`. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 420.00 Tm (updated middleware:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 398.00 Tm (- accepts token from cookie or `Authorization: Bearer <token>`;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 384.00 Tm (- uses validated JWT config from `env.js`;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 64.00 370.00 Tm (- returns a clean `401` response for missing, malformed, or expired tokens;) Tj ET
